## 5. Performance & Defensive Design

1. **O(1) In-Memory Lookups / No N+1 Queries**: `PlanHelper::filterEachPlan()` extracts all account IDs and performs bulk preloading of contact recordings, repossession requests, repossession status, and receipt encodings in single batch queries.
2. **Universal Data Compatibility**: Works with Eloquent Models, stdClass objects, and plain associative arrays.
3. **Graceful Fault Tolerance**: All database queries are protected with safety checks and error handling, ensuring the helper functions smoothly even during isolated unit testing or if tables are being migrated.
